---
pagination:
  data: catalog.volumes
  size: 1
  alias: book
permalink: "{{ book.url }}"
layout: layouts/base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "北师大版{{ book.grade | cn }}年级数学{{ book.volumeName }}教材目录｜单元知识点"
  description: "北师大版{{ book.grade | cn }}年级数学{{ book.volumeName }}课程目录，含{{ book.unitCount }}个学习单元的知识重点、教学重难点、课堂活动及课时导航。"
---
<nav class="crumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="/">首页</a> / <a href="/textbooks/bsd/">北师大版</a> / <a href="/textbooks/bsd/grade-{{ book.grade }}/">{{ book.grade | cn }}年级</a> / {{ book.volumeName }}</nav>
<section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">北师大版 · {{ book.revision }}</p><h1>{{ book.grade | cn }}年级数学{{ book.volumeName }}课程目录</h1><p class="lead">本册整理了{{ book.unitCount }}个主要学习单元。各单元提供知识梳理、易错提醒和课堂活动建议，便于教师根据实际进度备课。</p><p class="note">教材版本：{{ book.revision }}。<a href="/articles/textbook-edition-guide/">如何辨别新旧教材？</a></p></section>
<div class="unit-list">{% for item in book.units %}<article class="unit-row"><span class="unit-no">{% if item.order < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ item.order }}</span><div><h2><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h2><p>{{ item.focus }}</p><span class="tiny">{{ item.lessons.length }} 个课题</span></div><a class="more" href="{{ item.url }}" aria-label="查看{{ item.title }}">查看 →</a></article>{% endfor %}</div>
<section class="cta"><h2>本册互动课件</h2><p>{{ book.grade | cn }}年级{{ book.volumeName }}各单元的动画演示、课堂互动与练习设计，在十一课件的小红书主页持续更新。</p><a class="button" href="{{ site.social.xiaohongshu }}" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">去小红书看课件 ↗</a></section>
